# 16. Refresh Expectations (Product-Level)

- Queue cards (orders to accept, payments to review): near real-time after events
- Outstanding balances: immediately after payment approve/credit apply/invoice issue
- Trend graphs: period aggregates; may lag briefly but must reconcile to source lists
- Analytics disagreements: source list/document wins

---

# 17. Empty States

- New pharmacy with no connections: show discovery CTA, not fake charts
- Stockist with no orders: show empty inbox, not fabricated KPIs
- Zero overdue: show zero, not hide card

